OL,3,ADisruption at Port of Dover as masked
OL,4,Amen hold protest
OL,5,
OL,6,FKent Police, which made no arrests,
OL,7,Fmoved the crowd from the port to Dover
OL,8,FPriory railway station at about 11:30
OL,9,FBST and said "all involved had
OL,10,Fdispersed by 12:00".
